# Sprint 12 — Reddit Ingestion Verification

## Scope

Sprint 12 establishes Reddit as the first concrete external integration.

## Verified pipeline

Reddit test server
→ Reddit authentication
→ Reddit API client
→ Reddit DTO
→ normalization
→ external.Item
→ external.Identity
→ ingestion service
→ observability

## Test policy

Automated tests must not depend on the live Reddit service.

Reddit API behavior is simulated through the local external integration
test server.

## Security

The verification suite confirms that:

- Reddit client secrets are not logged.
- Access tokens are not logged.
- Authorization headers are not exposed in logs.
- Provider payloads are not exposed as Prometheus labels.
- External IDs are not Prometheus labels.

## Error contract

The following mappings are verified:

- 401 → ErrUnauthorized
- 403 → ErrForbidden
- 404 → ErrNotFound
- 429 → ErrRateLimited
- 5xx → ErrUpstream
- timeout → ErrTimeout
- malformed JSON → ErrInvalidPayload
- cancellation → context.Canceled

